---
const faqs=[
  ['Can I visit either office?','Yes. Services are available through both Chicago Heights and Mokena, with advanced programs scheduled by appointment.'],
  ['Do you offer same-day emergency care?','Same-day emergency care is listed at both offices. Call first so the team can assess urgency.'],
  ['Can I see fixed, monthly and yearly pricing?','Yes. Customer-facing pricing is organized in all three formats. Case-dependent treatment may change after clinical planning.'],
  ['What does complete-health dentistry mean?','The practice connects oral health with airway, sleep, inflammation and wider health signals.'],
  ['Do you welcome children and anxious patients?','Yes. The service map includes pediatric care, HealthyStart, nitrous oxide and virtual-reality comfort options.'],
];
---

<section class="split-story" id="locations" data-split-story>
  <div class="split-sticky">
    <header class="split-title"><p class="eyebrow">Choose your door</p><h2>Same care.<br /><em>Two rhythms.</em></h2></header>
    <div class="office-split">
      <article class="office office--chicago" data-office="chicago"><div class="office-media"><img src="/images/generated/unique/home-location-chicago.webp" alt="A welcoming arrival at the Chicago Heights office" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="office-copy"><span>01 · Chicago Heights</span><h3>500 Ashland Ave,<br />Suite #2</h3><a href="tel:+17087551333">(708) 755-1333</a><p>Mon–Thu 7:30–7 · Fri 7:30–12 · Sat 8–12</p><a class="map" href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/htHhNrnhbbu2WNR17">Open map ↗</a></div></article>
      <article class="office office--mokena" data-office="mokena"><div class="office-media"><img src="/images/generated/unique/home-location-mokena.webp" alt="A calm patient welcome at the Mokena office" loading="lazy" /></div><div class="office-copy"><span>02 · Mokena</span><h3>19160<br />88th Avenue</h3><a href="tel:+17084797733">(708) 479-7733</a><p>Mon 8–7 · Thu 9:30–6 · Every other Sat 8–12</p><a class="map" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ashland+Dental+and+Wellness+Center+19160+88th+Avenue+Mokena+IL+60448">Open map ↗</a></div></article>
    </div>
    <div class="split-instruction" aria-hidden="true"><span>Chicago Heights</span><i></i><span>Mokena</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq" id="faq"><div class="container-shell faq-grid"><header class="faq-heading" data-fade><p class="eyebrow">Questions, answered</p><h2>Start with<br /><em>clarity.</em></h2><a href="/#faq">View all FAQs ↗</a></header><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map((faq,index)=><details data-fade><summary><span>0{index+1}</span>{faq[0]}<i>+</i></summary><p>{faq[1]}</p></details>)}</div></div></section>

<footer class="site-footer" id="contact" data-footer-story>
  <div class="footer-sticky">
    <div class="footer-grid" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
    <header class="footer-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Ready when you are</p>
      <h2 aria-label="Ready for a different visit?">
        <span data-footer-line="one">Ready for a</span>
        <span data-footer-line="two"><em>different visit?</em></span>
      </h2>
    </header>

    <div class="footer-portal" data-footer-portal>
      <div class="footer-portal__contact">
        <img src="/brand/smiles-by-noetzel-mark.svg" alt="" />
        <div class="footer-portal__copy" data-footer-portal-copy>
          <p>Thoughtful dentistry begins with a real conversation.</p>
          <div class="footer-portal__links">
            <a href="#appointment-form">Book your visit <i>↓</i></a>
            <a href="tel:+17087551333">(708) 755-1333</a>
            <a href="mailto:nadia.ashland@gmail.com">Email the team</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <form
        class="footer-form"
        id="appointment-form"
        action="https://formsubmit.co/ajax/nadia.ashland@gmail.com"
        method="POST"
        data-appointment-form
        data-footer-form
      >
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New website appointment request" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_template" value="table" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_captcha" value="false" />
        <label class="footer-form__trap" aria-hidden="true">Leave this empty<input name="_honey" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" /></label>
        <label class="footer-form__field">
          <span>Your name</span>
          <input name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="First and last name" />
        </label>
        <label class="footer-form__field">
          <span>Phone</span>
          <input name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" required placeholder="(000) 000-0000" />
        </label>
        <label class="footer-form__field">
          <span>Email</span>
          <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required placeholder="you@email.com" />
        </label>
        <label class="footer-form__field">
          <span>Preferred office</span>
          <select name="office" required>
            <option value="" selected disabled>Select a location</option>
            <option value="Chicago Heights">Chicago Heights</option>
            <option value="Mokena">Mokena</option>
            <option value="No preference">No preference</option>
          </select>
        </label>
        <button class="footer-form__submit" type="submit">
          <span>Send request</span><i aria-hidden="true">↗</i>
        </button>
        <div class="footer-form__meta">
          <p>Scheduling request only—please don’t include confidential medical information.</p>
          <output aria-live="polite" data-form-status></output>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="container-shell footer-bottom" data-footer-bottom>
      <div class="footer-bottom__nav">
        <div><strong>Smiles by Noetzel</strong><span>Ashland Dental &amp; Wellness Center</span></div>
        <nav aria-label="Footer"><a href="/services/">Services</a><a href="/service-areas/">Service Areas</a><a href="/#pricing">Pricing</a><a href="/#team">Team</a><a href="/#faq">FAQ</a></nav>
        <span>Chicago Heights · Mokena</span>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-details" aria-label="Practice information">
        <section>
          <span>01 · Chicago Heights</span>
          <a class="footer-details__phone" href="tel:+17087551333">(708) 755-1333</a>
          <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/htHhNrnhbbu2WNR17">500 Ashland Ave, Suite #2<br />Chicago Heights, IL 60411 ↗</a>
          <p>Mon–Thu 7:30 AM–7 PM · Fri 7:30 AM–12 PM<br />Sat 8 AM–12 PM · Sun closed</p>
        </section>
        <section>
          <span>02 · Mokena</span>
          <a class="footer-details__phone" href="tel:+17084797733">(708) 479-7733</a>
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ashland+Dental+and+Wellness+Center+19160+88th+Avenue+Mokena+IL+60448">19160 88th Avenue, Mokena, IL 60448 ↗</a>
          <p>Mon 8 AM–7 PM · Thu 9:30 AM–6 PM<br />Every other Sat 8 AM–12 PM* · Other days closed</p>
        </section>
        <section class="footer-details__connect">
          <span>Connect</span>
          <a class="footer-details__email" href="mailto:nadia.ashland@gmail.com">nadia.ashland@gmail.com ↗</a>
          <nav aria-label="Social media"><a href="https://www.facebook.com/ashlanddentalcenter/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Facebook ↗</a><a href="https://www.instagram.com/ashlanddentalcenter/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Instagram ↗</a></nav>
          <p>*Saturday hours may vary; please call ahead.</p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

